How the patch works
-------------------

The source for everything here is in this repository: the wrapper library in
proxy/, the installer and tooling in tools/. Releases are built from an allowlist
by tools/make-release.sh, which scans the result for game formats before writing
it.

The patch is a wrapper library (binkw32.dll) that loads alongside the game and
adjusts it in memory while it runs. It does not modify Tropico.EXE, and it does
not modify or repack the game's archives. The original binkw32.dll is preserved
next to it as binkw32_orig.dll, and every one of its functions is forwarded to
that original file; no third-party video code is reimplemented or redistributed.

Everything the installer does is reversible with the supplied uninstaller.


